   "date": "2016-11-21",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The speaker announced support for the Marriage Legislation Amendment Bill 2016 [No. 2], citing rural and regional support from the electorate of Indi, including the Anglican synod of Wangaratta and a 16-year-old student named Harry, and called on the government to legalise same-sex marriage without further delay."
  },
