   "slug": "speech-337669",
   "speaker": "Madeleine King",
   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2016-11-21",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The speaker argued for immediate passage of the Marriage Legislation Amendment Bill 2016 to achieve marriage equality, opposed a non-binding plebiscite as a political tool that would cause harm, and called on Parliament to legislate directly to end discrimination against same-sex couples."
  }
